{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0053_1000_p", "source_sha256": "93ef8aa3f5c9bc993c887e5015611f7ec21a857a3cab015ea8d4497016935a70", "ja": "（エレナと美也のCleaskyお披露目ライブは\n大盛況！　もう、2度目のアンコールだ……！）", "zh": "（艾琳娜和美也的『Cleasky』首次亮相演唱会盛况空前！\n现在已经是第二次安可了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0053_1002_p", "source_sha256": "965cf7e52a679578a1cdd2a0389c80a9769a2bbcafca62bc27a599482ce922d3", "ja": "エレナ、アンコールお疲れさま！\nすごくよかったぞ。", "zh": "艾琳娜，安可辛苦了！\n你唱得很棒喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0053_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "f012a4eb19ef984fad6f7950f6cc2ed574c0ca3fe82db7a3e83d7d650f7211da", "ja": "ホント？　エヘヘ、よかった♪　ミヤと一緒に、\n劇場のみんなにもいっぱい手伝ってもらったからネ♪", "zh": "真的吗？嘿嘿，太好了♪因为是和美也一起表演，\n而且剧场的大家也帮了很多忙喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0053_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "f2010468d0a7e7e75a5bbaa4f0269638f313adde9e8c714b537ad064e6028f7f", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}。ワタシ、今とっても\n楽しいはずなのに、何だか胸がきゅーってするんだヨ。", "zh": "{$P$}，我问你喔。\n我现在应该要很开心才对，但又觉得内心揪成一团。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0053_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "cced489ede77f1628785424cdaa68ad9e1c084269a7f4c3c5b3920205b3afc36", "ja": "せっかくの、楽しいライブなのに……。\nこんなのって、ダメだよネ？", "zh": "明明今天的演唱会这么开心……\n这样子是不是不太好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0053_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c94d6baadee4cc23229f42a4fd6c471f36390c01d7443c0d15d171fcd4c62ff4", "ja": "胸がきゅーってする？\nうーん……それは、そのままでもいいと思うけどな。", "zh": "内心揪成一团？\n唔……我觉得这样也很好喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0053_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "1d9319212c6c0e0588e81a94a33a8b409834d0401954d50074de5f2b3b1f819d", "ja": "えっ……そうなノ？", "zh": "咦……是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0053_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c9e7994e211d50c990a74e15509ae7e7689ca5033e026b8daf1b537cd9d4c269", "ja": "うん。たとえば……エレナは今回、美也とふたりで\nCleaskyのために、いろんなことをしたよな。", "zh": "嗯。比方说……艾琳娜，这次你和美也两个人\n为了『Cleasky』做了很多努力，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0053_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "fcace4c91185e43dc32c08163339299b11c3f94a4cb33fa9cd707af66edcb689", "ja": "うん！　ミヤと遊んだり、みんなに話を聞いたり……\nとっても楽しかったヨ♪", "zh": "对啊！我和美也一起玩，也问了大家很多事情……\n非常开心喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0053_1010_p", "source_sha256": "00946e493119e3161d7eaa264d4c039b2068af935e1790977da21433b99ed5fe", "ja": "その後、歌やダンスのレッスンがたくさんあったけど\n……その時の事は、もう全部忘れちゃったか？", "zh": "之后，你们上了很多歌唱和舞蹈的训练课程……\n那些事情你全都忘了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0053_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "56fa3bfd625b52cdb699d6182413889b0322a14eaf7ea5d4bf38e2c12466ec5a", "ja": "え！？　全然、そんなことないヨ！\nワタシ、ちゃんと覚えてるヨ！", "zh": "咦！？我一点都没忘啊！\n全都记得很清楚喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0053_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "1630365a6d0aba82aa62886edabb4a8d199a8ef6fe4db8f8cb3e2294f29354f0", "ja": "だって、あんなに楽しかったんだかラ！\n全部全部、絶対に忘れたくない……あっ。", "zh": "因为那些时候真的好开心！\n我全都不想忘记……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0053_1013_p", "source_sha256": "7da0db05353bd47ba313f2b3ad54dfbacbcac1263d81a5a9f723bdbcd3cb9e67", "ja": "エレナ？", "zh": "艾琳娜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0053_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "01f0e243bb84bcb026b7ea45ab941e837a53e6a8ff43e51051521e9cc37cd8cf", "ja": "今、胸がきゅーってしたヨ……。そっか……\nワタシ、忘れたくなかったんだ。ステージのコト……。", "zh": "我刚才心里又揪了一下……我知道了……\n是因为我不想忘记，我不想忘记这次的表演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0053_1015_p", "source_sha256": "afad3b47946327fee7789cd03d9a8373b53baf905d0a2e03e3edde14f791c399", "ja": "うん。だから、そのままでいいと思う。\n忘れたくないっていう、エレナの気持ち……。", "zh": "没错。所以，我才觉得这样也很好。\n艾琳娜，你的内心不想忘记这次表演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0053_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7b04789890128818afea703cfab8d2aecef05bb1e37332e4177a99bdc52b49cd", "ja": "それがファンのみんなにも届いたから、こうして、\n2度もアンコールをしてくれたんじゃないかな。", "zh": "这样的感受也都传达给粉丝们了，\n所以，才会有两次安可不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0053_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "0df9a5a6225739a2b118d18271f9612d598dddd7fa0c5d43ba65eab0cb73178d", "ja": "そうなのかナ……。\nうん……そうだったら、嬉しいナ……♪", "zh": "是这样吗……\n嗯……如果真的是这样，我好开心啊……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0053_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "e5b174b2aa6ef13f5b998f0a749a95aebe38c49dbc397e990140792b363bf002", "ja": "{$P$}。{$P$}も、\nいつかワタシのコト、忘れちゃったりするのかナ？", "zh": "{$P$}，\n{$P$}以后也会忘记我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0053_1019_p", "source_sha256": "56590bcdf521f114912281f877b8ef41fefcdf7936666c29f30598b100e1f678", "ja": "忘れないよ。エレナの事も、今日のステージも、\n俺は絶対に忘れない。約束するよ。", "zh": "我不会忘记。不管是艾琳娜还是今天的表演，\n我绝对不会忘记。我向你保证。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0053_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "885b2648aa560f658c3fafc6d20c40bf7a57058eccdef00f03611ef0286e0305", "ja": "本当！？　エヘヘ……。\nじゃあワタシも、忘れないって約束するネ♪", "zh": "真的吗！？嘿嘿……\n那我也保证，不会忘记你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0053_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "286c37765bd6bce86cd982f176aca7d8b036e1368199f5a22e2465128671c22f", "ja": "エレナはずーっと、{$P$}の\nアイドルだからネ！　約束だヨっ♪", "zh": "艾琳娜永～远都是{$P$}的偶像！\n一言为定喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
